ss=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">姐妹们急忙争吵。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">仕舞</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しまい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">结束；完毕；终止；素衣舞；能剧素衣舞蹈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しまう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完成；结束；终止；停止；关闭；停业；关门；歇业；收起；放好；保存；存放；完全做完；做到底；无意中做；不小心做；碰巧做；最终落得</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"81664\"><ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とノートをしまいなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">放下书和笔记。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しまった</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">糟糕；完了；哎呀；哦不</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216081\">しまった！ウッカリして、<ruby>携帯電話<rp>(</rp><rt>けいたいでんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をお<ruby>店<rp>(</rp><rt>みせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>忘<rp>(</rp><rt>わす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてきちゃった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不好意思!我忘记了手机在店里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">始末</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しまつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">处理；料理；解决；清理；处置；事情的经过；情形；详情；结果（通常指坏的结果）；后果；节俭；节约；俭朴；勤俭</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218390\">これは<ruby>始末<rp>(</rp><rt>しまつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>難<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是一个艰难的终结问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">閉まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">关闭；闭合；紧实；结实；被锁上；锁定；拧紧；绷紧；清醒；变得紧张</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234558\">あいにく<ruby>店<rp>(</rp><rt>みせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>閉<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那时,商店就关闭了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しみじみ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">深深地；真切地；诚心诚意地；平静地；安静地；柔和地；目不转睛地；专注地；凝视地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"95005\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはその<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がしみじみ<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她感觉到这个故事很紧张。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">染みる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しみる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span cl